INSERT INTO [dbo].[TBLICERIK] ([ID], [BASLIK], [ICERIK], [TARIH], [DOSYA]) VALUES (1, N'TOGU İFTAR', N'<br><div class="entry-thumbnail single-entry-thumbnail mt-clearfix" style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px; color: rgb(61, 61, 61); font-family: Muli; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);"><figure class="post-thumb cover-image" style="margin-bottom: 0px; box-sizing: inherit; line-height: 0; position: relative;"><img width="1200" height="1600" src="https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24.jpeg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="TOGÜ TÖMER Ailesi İftarda Bir Araya Geldi" itemprop="image" decoding="async" srcset="https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24.jpeg 1200w, https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-225x300.jpeg 225w, https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-450x600.jpeg 450w, https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-113x150.jpeg 113w, https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-768x1024.jpeg 768w, https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-1152x1536.jpeg 1152w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" style="box-sizing: inherit; height: 1120px; max-width: 100%; width: 840px; object-fit: cover;"></figure></div><div class="entry-meta single-entry-meta" style="box-sizing: inherit; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-bottom: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); color: rgb(61, 61, 61); font-family: Muli; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);"><div class="entry-meta-posted-by posted-by-wrap" style="box-sizing: inherit; display: flex; align-items: center;"><span class="byline" style="box-sizing: inherit;"><span class="author vcard" style="box-sizing: inherit;"><a class="url fn n" href="https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/h/author/kurumsaliletisim" style="box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); transition-duration: 0.2s; transition-property: all; border-color: rgb(10, 113, 192); font-weight: 600;">Kurumsal İletişim Koordinatörlüğü</a></span></span></div><div class="entry-meta-comment comment-mark" style="box-sizing: inherit;"></div><div class="post-views content-post post-11170 entry-meta load-static" style="box-sizing: inherit; line-height: 1.3;"><span class="post-views-label" style="box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px !important; padding-right: 5px; cursor: pointer;"><span class="dashicons dashicons-share" title="Paylaş" style="box-sizing: inherit; font-family: dashicons; display: inline-block; line-height: 1; text-decoration: inherit; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; width: 20px; height: 20px; font-size: 20px; vertical-align: top; transition: color 0.1s ease-in;"></span>Paylaş</span>&nbsp;<span class="post-views-count" style="box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px !important; font-weight: bold;"><span class="dashicons dashicons-visibility" style="box-sizing: inherit; font-family: dashicons; display: inline-block; line-height: 1; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: inherit; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; width: 20px; height: 20px; font-size: 20px; vertical-align: top; transition: color 0.1s ease-in;"></span>154</span></div></div><div class="entry-content single-entry-summary mt-clearfix" itemprop="text" style="box-sizing: inherit; counter-reset: footnotes 0; margin: 1.5rem 0px 30px; color: rgb(61, 61, 61); font-family: Muli; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);"><p style="box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.8; line-break: auto; text-align: justify;">TOGÜ TÖMER tarafından iftar programı düzenlendi. Programa Rektör Yardımcısı Prof. Dr. Mücahit Eğri, TÖMER Müdürü Dr. Öğr. Üyesi Ahmet Akgül, TÖMER müdür yardımcıları, öğretim üyeleri ve öğretim görevlileri ile birlikte farklı ülkelerden gelen yaklaşık 120 öğrenci katıldı.</p><p style="box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.8; line-break: auto; text-align: justify;">Ramazan ayının birlik ve dayanışma ruhunun hissedildiği programda, farklı kültürlerden öğrenciler aynı sofrada buluşarak paylaşmanın ve kardeşliğin en güzel örneklerinden birini sergiledi. İftar öncesinde başlayan samimi sohbetler, ezanın okunmasıyla birlikte paylaşılan iftar sofralarıyla daha da anlam kazandı.</p><p style="box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.8; line-break: auto; text-align: justify;">Sıcak ve samimi bir atmosferde gerçekleşen program, öğrenciler ile akademik personel arasındaki etkileşimi güçlendirirken, TÖMER ailesi için de unutulmaz bir Ramazan akşamı olarak hafızalarda yer etti.</p><figure class="wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex" style="margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 30px; box-sizing: inherit; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: normal; display: flex; --wp--style--unstable-gallery-gap: 0.5em; text-align: center; justify-content: center;"><figure class="wp-block-image size-large" style="margin-bottom: 0px; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; max-width: 100%; position: relative; width: calc(33.33% - 5.33336px); align-self: inherit;"><a href="https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-1.jpeg" style="box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(10, 113, 192); transition-duration: 0.2s; transition-property: all; border-color: rgb(10, 113, 192); display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1 0 0%; margin: 0px; height: 366.219px; object-fit: cover; width: 274.656px;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="600" data-id="11171" src="https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-1-800x600.jpeg" alt="" class="wp-image-11171" srcset="https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-1-800x600.jpeg 800w, https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-1-400x300.jpeg 400w, https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-1-200x150.jpeg 200w, https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-1-768x576.jpeg 768w, https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-1-1536x1152.jpeg 1536w, https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-1.jpeg 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" style="height: 366.219px; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: bottom; display: block; width: 274.656px; flex: 1 0 0%; object-fit: cover;"></a></figure><figure class="wp-block-image size-large" style="margin-bottom: 0px; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; max-width: 100%; position: relative; width: calc(33.33% - 5.33336px); align-self: inherit;"><a href="https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-10-at-22.47.24-2.jpeg" style="box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(10, 113, 192); transition-duration: 0.2s; transition-property: all; border-color: rgb(10, 113, 192); display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1 0 0%; margin: 0px; height: 366.219px; object-fit: cover; width: 274.672px;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="600" data-id="11174" src="https://toguhaber.gop.edu.tr/wp-content/uploads/sites/7